---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="A considered strategy for your sale">
  <section class="section wrap">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">For sellers</p>
      <h1>
        Your home.
        <br />
        Your next chapter.
      </h1>
      <p>
        Bring preparation, presentation, and a clear plan together for your
        sale.
      </p>
      <h2>01 / Understand your position</h2>
      <p>
        Review your goals, timing, property condition, and current comparable
        sales with your agent.
      </p>
      <h2>02 / Prepare and present</h2>
      <p>
        Prioritize practical improvements and agree on a marketing approach for
        your property.
      </p>
      <h2>03 / Navigate the details</h2>
      <p>
        Compare offers and contingencies, coordinate next steps, and stay
        informed through closing. No sale price or timeline is guaranteed.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a class="button" href="/contact/">
          Let’s start with a conversation ↗
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
